    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102291" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰνᾰ-ήκης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with long point</i> or <i>edge</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταναήκεϊ χαλκῷ</span>, of a sword or spear,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				7.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.754
			</span></i>; of an axe, <i><span class="en">
				23.118
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tall</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοῖνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄλπεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					1126
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τανυήκης</span> is freq.
		v.l.)</div>
